+     if present, else result, as a MemoryRoll. Return its patterns and canaries EXACTLY as found there, verbatim —
+     never judge, filter, rank, summarize or alter them in any way. If the file is missing, unreadable, empty, or
+     not shaped like a MemoryRoll, return patterns: [] and canaries: [] rather than guessing. Do not create, edit
+     or delete any file, and do not run any command that changes the repository — you read one file and report
+     its contents, nothing else.`,
+    { label: 'memory:read', model: MODEL.cheap, ...AT('memory-analyst'), schema: MemoryExtraction })
+  const chosenPatterns = selectPatterns(mem?.patterns)
+  const formatted = formatPatterns(chosenPatterns)
+  if (formatted) {
